| Reaction: Fe + 6CN → FeCN$_6^{4-}$ |
| :---: |
| Initial (mol/mol) | 1.0 | 1.0 | 0 |
| Change (mol/mol) | -x | -6x | +x |
| Final (mol/mol) | 1.0 - x | 1.0 - 6x | x |

