The total area of the courtyard is:
Area of courtyard = Length × Width
Area of courtyard = 50 m × 16.5 m
Area of courtyard = 825 m²

The total area covered by the 165 paving stones is:
Area of each paving stone = Length × Width
Area of courtyard = 165 × (2.5 m × width)

