\]

Approximating \( \pi \approx 3.14159 \):

\[
B \approx 1000 \times 3.14159 \, \text{N/m} \approx 3141.59 \, \text{N/m}
\]

Thus, the magnetic field strength at the center of the circular coil is \(\boxed{3141.59 \, \text{N/m}}\).
